# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0223.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Connected Mode -> Extended DRX: Release
Extended DRX -> Power Saving Mode: eDRX expiry
Power Saving Mode -> Connected Mode: Wake (TAU timer or MO data)

Active { Connected Mode }
Light Sleep (eDRX) { Extended DRX }
Deep Sleep (PSM) { Power Saving Mode }
